            <note corresp="#d650-f6" n="5" xml:id="d650-f6-content">
                <p>According to telegram No. 406, December 23, from the Minister in Denmark,
                    arrangements were finally completed for the release of the detained tobacco in
                    compliance with existing regulations. (File No. 763.72112/3248.)</p>
            </note>
